{"server":"tw","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_07_end","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_07","title":"破冰","storyCode":"BI-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"e9e28156a395dcc4cfd0ebcaed8d31fa36e9d8230d62c1db2c1ce45294be5998","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"level_act14side_07_end"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......切斯特叔叔，為什麼我不能出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁吩咐了，在他回來之前，不允許你四處跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那老哥什麼時候回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁現在應當正在前往聖山的路上，過兩天就能回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想去散步也不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在宅子附近的話......我會派人跟著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞，現在謝拉格的形勢十分險峻，這也是為了你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g8_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老哥......你就一定要這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我該怎麼辦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極光？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——好嚴密的守備，我好不容易才進來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是和Sharp隊長一起去博士那邊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我這次來，就是博士有話要我帶給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，阿克托斯在領地內集結了大量士兵，但是，這支隊伍的領導者是那位博士，而不是阿克托斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚......根據眼線的回報，在將這支隊伍的指揮權正式交給博士後，他就不知所蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個博士的隊伍是誘餌？不，不會這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"規模呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩爾羅契領地響應阿克托斯號召的家族和您想像的差不多，以此估算的話——阿克托斯應該不可能再集結起另外一支同樣規模的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他不可能待在後方，有另一支隊伍的可能性很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩爾羅契家的戰士本來就很擅長在山野中行動，這確實不是沒有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，無論是誘餌還是主力，這支隊伍都不能放任不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓魏斯傳令，命戰士們在山下集結，等候命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後派人去盯著大部隊，你主要負責去找出阿克托斯的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g8_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......希望我能登上聖山，潛入蔓珠院去找姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士的意思是，如今，佩爾羅契家和希瓦艾什家之間的衝突已經幾乎無法避免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果說還有一個人可以阻止這一切的話，那麼，這個人必然是你的姐姐，當代聖女，恩雅·希瓦艾什。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，博士是想秉承羅德島不干政的方針，選擇袖手旁觀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，博士指出一點，既然還政對於恩希歐迪斯先生來說只是一個幌子，那麼他也必然不會將對謝拉格的信仰放在眼中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一旦希瓦艾什家的部隊真的擊敗了佩爾羅契家的部隊，那麼對他來說，阻攔他將謝拉格納入囊中的，也就只有蔓珠院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是謝拉格人民的信仰對象，聖女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士說，他並不是想要讓你去說服聖女做些什麼，而是你曾經拜託過他，希望他能夠幫忙緩和你們兄妹之間關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他對於自己來到謝拉格後沒有幫上忙一直感到有些自責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼能怪博士！我才要對博士和隨行的各位道歉，明明應該是一次愉快的旅行，結果卻因為老哥而變成了這個樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不怪你呀，崖心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，博士的意思是，他可以不在乎很多東西，但一方面他從一開始就被恩希歐迪斯先生捲了進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面，你是恩希歐迪斯先生的妹妹也是不爭的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，博士還是打算做一些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你上山，是希望你能成為聖女身邊的保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士希望我在必要的時候去阻止老哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者在必要的時候帶著聖女逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩希亞下意識地摸了摸自己手中的繩環。\n這是小時候，姐姐親手為她編織的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一次潛入行動，我和其他的隨行幹員會一起協助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有更好的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家只要能幫我到達聖山腳下就好，剩下的，交給我一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，為什麼你要把行軍的速度控制得這麼慢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"要讓觀察著我們的眼睛再多欣賞欣賞。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"現在還不能快。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，古羅你該不會還沒搞清楚我們要幹什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是吸引希瓦艾什家的注意嗎？我就是覺得有點太慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你就是想直接衝過去和希瓦艾什家打一仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前被瓦萊絲壓了一頭，我現在胸口憋著一口氣呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩爾羅契家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在大典上被抓走的尤卡坦的位置確認了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩爾羅契家戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和您想的一樣，沒有被帶回希瓦艾什家的領地，而是就近關在了山腳下的鎮子裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"辛苦了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你可真厲害啊，這麼短的時間裡就能摸清楚尤卡坦老爺被關押的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這點情報收集，我布朗陶家的人也做得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，既然確認了尤卡坦的位置，我和這個傻大個也該動起來了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沉默什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，原來你在喊我嗎？我可不是傻大個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古羅！將軍！哼......這樣就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，你知道你要做什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，去最近的車站搞點破壞，讓你有機會去救你丈夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替博士警告你一句，別真的搞出人命來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，車站裡都是些平民百姓，我古羅是絕不會對他們出手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，博士，要是希瓦艾什家的人真來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能說，我會儘量留手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崖心，你說你要找的......是你的登山設備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，你要攀登喀蘭聖山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......按照你說的，現在別說聖山上，聖山下肯定也有很多人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要從正面上聖山，就算是Sharp隊長大概也很難潛進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這可難不倒我~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能到達山腳下，剩下的交給我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......這樣的話，我和其他人就不能保護你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也在羅德島接受過許多訓練，一般的對手我還是應付得過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞，你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斯特叔叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要去登山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去登哪座山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喀蘭聖山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡即將成為戰場，你過去會受傷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去那裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斯特叔叔，自從我愛上登山之後，我就一直想要用自己的雙手爬上喀蘭聖山看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從姐姐成為聖女離我們而去之後，這想法就越來越強烈......總有一天，我要爬上它的頂峰，把姐姐接回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，這個機會來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到的，恩希亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......即使我做不到把姐姐帶回家，至少在這個時候，我也要陪在姐姐身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老哥做了這麼多的事，姐姐一定也很迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有辦法阻止老哥，那麼，至少，我要陪在姐姐的身邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奧拉維爾，你最小的女兒，也已經長大了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_286_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐，抱歉，老爺的命令是，為了您的安全著想，不允許您離開這座宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......停手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斯特叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_286_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斯特經理，你這是違抗老爺的命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡發生的事一切責任由我承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_286_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......雖然你都這麼說了，可是二小姐她的安危......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什家的人，從來不會冒無謂的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，就相信她吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_286_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，為二小姐和幾位羅德島的客人準備最好的馱獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希瓦艾什家士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_286_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，切斯特叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，切斯特經理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直以為您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必謝我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，時間緊迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亞","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧拉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你和伊莉莎白死後，我一直後悔，過去應該支持你對領地的改革，而不是與你作對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，當你兒子想要繼承你的理想時，我選擇了毫無保留地支持他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯他做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩雅作為聖女也得到了謝拉格人的愛戴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞雖然得了礦石病，但她的病情得到了抑制，而且一如既往地開朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"切斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_267_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我剛才忽然反應過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我有多久沒有見到這三個孩子聚在一起，露出兄妹之間應有的笑容了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g3_mainhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大長老，您應當好好休息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照記錄，這座大殿，是在三族議會成立後，三族的人民共同建造的。三族人民的存在與合作要遠遠早於現代三族制度的建立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，過了上千年，中間修修補補，最終成了現在的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這張椅子，也在這裡擺了上千年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有十幾位大長老坐在這張椅子上面，度過了他們的一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就好像，有十幾位聖女，都在這座山上鬱鬱而終。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，聖女就是蔓珠院為了方便信仰傳播而捏造出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大長老在這個時候提及我早就知道的事實，難道是想說，信仰是虛假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話也直接起來了，但事情恰恰相反，恩雅，不，聖女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女，咳咳，你知道老朽的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座蔓珠院中，恐怕已經沒人記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連老朽自己，都已經忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一任的大長老，在接過上一任的衣缽之後，都會只成為大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將來，人們也會忘記你的名字，只知道你叫作聖女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，大長老和聖女都會發現——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們信仰的，並非耶拉岡德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們可以信仰任何東西，只要一個故事，一些巧合，他們就會信仰你，信仰我，信仰恩希歐迪斯，信仰山，信仰水，甚至信仰一片樹葉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然人們什麼都可以信仰，那麼信仰究竟是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大長老們最終得出了答案："},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們信仰的，是信仰本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們將選擇權交給信仰的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們將自己排斥的事物統統歸咎於信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們無條件地信任著信仰所指導的生活方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以信仰是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰是懶惰，是逃避，是頹廢！信仰是安定，信仰是停滯！咳咳咳咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您該休息了，大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，聖女，聖女！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大長老倏地抓住恩雅的手腕。\n力道之大，在恩雅的皮膚上都留下了紅印，彷彿把他畢生的力量都用在了這上面。\n他的雙眼盯著眼前的聖女，卻彷彿在看著別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰醜惡！但即使如此，沒有人能夠摧毀信仰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格歷經千年，三大家族之間隔閡漸深，卻無人能夠否定信仰，信仰是謝拉格之所以是謝拉格的根基！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰將謝拉格人統合在了一起，人們追求信仰，人們依賴信仰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格由此存在了千年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們渴望安定，人們渴望停滯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯以為他贏了，他沒有，他不可能贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他憑什麼戰勝謝拉格這千年以來凝聚而成的信仰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老朽已經要不行了，但你還年輕，你是這蔓珠院的聖女，你也將成為這蔓珠院的大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去教會他，去戰勝他，讓他明白，信仰面前，他的那些動作不值一提！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅沉默片刻，卻將大長老的手硬生生地從自己手腕上掰開。\n她的眼中有著對眼前老人的憐憫，更多的，卻是堅決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不同意，大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說信仰意味著停滯，人們依賴信仰，是因為他們渴望安定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誠然，人一旦有所信仰，總會習慣性地依賴信仰。懶惰、逃避、頹廢......您說的這些，我不否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這絕不是說，信仰意味著停滯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰就是信仰，信仰本身是沒有屬性的，信仰的內容是被賦予的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰向前走，信仰的人也會向前走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰停下，信仰的人也會停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格的人們之所以在您的眼中嚮往著停滯，正是因為對耶拉岡德的信仰在蔓珠院手中停滯了千年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們遵循著某種約定俗成的規則畫地為牢，在這片雪山之中生活了上千年，不去探究外面的天地，不與外面的人交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而這種約定俗成，真的和信仰有關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這難道不是只是蔓珠院的傲慢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傲慢？不，不，它本該如此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有什麼事本該如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有，那它一定只是從未有所改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該改變了，大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女，不，你改變不了什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大長老","speakerId":"avg_npc_258_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信仰，咳咳......是謝拉格之所以是謝拉格的根基......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去和恩希歐迪斯對抗，但不是以您想要的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道我能不能成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，聖女既然從一開始就是蔓珠院用來引導民眾信仰的工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就讓這個工具真正發揮效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是聖女，但我不是蔓珠院的聖女，而是謝拉格的聖女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會用我的方式去引導人民，讓他們能夠自由地去前進，去探究，去冒險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您，該休息了，大長老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來人，將大長老扶回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩雅站起身，頭也不回地走向正殿門外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而在她的背後，大長老坐在椅子上，注視著她的背影，他伸出手，似乎想要握住什麼，最終卻無力地垂下。\n他什麼也沒有握住。\n他永遠地停在了那裡，一如他夢中的謝拉格雪山。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
